OL,3,GNEWSAJury retires in bar punch murder
OL,4,Atrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has retired to consider its
OL,7,Fverdict on a man accused of murder
OL,8,Fafter a pub owner was killed by a punch
OL,9,Fto the neck.
OL,11,FBilly Allison, 36, denies murdering
OL,12,F44-year-old Matthew O'Gara at the Ricco
OL,13,Fand Loren bar in Lichfield on 24 May,
OL,14,Fbut has admitted manslaughter.
OL,16,FProsecutors at Stafford Crown Court
OL,17,Fallege Allison deliberately targeted
OL,18,Fthe head and neck areas of O'Gara and
OL,19,Fhis friend Adam Cooper.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
