OL,4,Atrial
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllison, of Shirley, Solihull, also
OL,7,Fadmitted inflicting grievous bodily
OL,8,Fharm against Cooper, 62, but denies
OL,9,Fsection 18 grievous bodily harm with
OL,10,Fintent.
